@UserManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5253
@apiToken = local-development-only-token

### Missing token (expect 401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users

### Invalid token (expect 401)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Valid token can reach the API
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Create a user
# @name createUser
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Alex Morgan",
	"email": "alex.morgan@example.com",
	"department": "Human Resources"
}

### Retrieve all users
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve the created user
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update the created user
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Alex Morgan",
	"email": "alex.morgan@example.com",
	"department": "Information Technology"
}

### Delete the created user
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Verify the user was deleted (expect 404)
GET {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid request (expect 400)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "",
	"email": "not-an-email",
	"department": ""
}

### Display name is not an email address (expect 400)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Invalid Email Probe",
	"email": "Display Name <probe@example.com>",
	"department": "IT"
}

### Update a non-existent user (expect 404)
PUT {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Missing User",
	"email": "missing@example.com",
	"department": "IT"
}

### Delete a non-existent user (expect 404)
DELETE {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Malformed JSON body (expect 400 Problem Details)
POST {{UserManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{malformed json

